<section id="open-web" aria-labelledby="ow-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Built on the open social web</p>
      <h2 id="ow-title">Keep everything that works today. Gain what you never had.</h2>
      <p>Rostrum runs on the AT Protocol, the open network behind Bluesky and a growing family of apps known as the Atmosphere. You keep the reach, speed and familiarity of the big platforms. Ownership, verification and choice come with it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="keepgain">
      <div class="kg-col">
        <p class="eyebrow">What you keep</p>
        <h3>The public square you already know</h3>
        <ul class="kg-list">
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div><strong>Real-time public conversation</strong><span>Posts, threads, replies, quotes, reposts, video and direct messages. It works the way you expect.</span></div></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div><strong>An audience that is already there</strong><span>Millions of people, and many of Europe's journalists, already use Bluesky and other Atmosphere apps. Your Rostrum account reaches all of them from day one.</span></div></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div><strong>Familiar apps on every phone</strong><span>Rostrum is your account, not another app to learn. Post from Bluesky, mu or any app on the network.</span></div></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div><strong>No need to leave anywhere overnight</strong><span>Publish once and cross-post to the networks you still use. An open bridge also carries your posts to Mastodon and the wider fediverse.</span></div></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div><strong>Discovery, embeds and press pick-up</strong><span>Search, trending topics and shareable posts that embed in websites, newsletters and news coverage.</span></div></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div><strong>Your existing followers</strong><span>Already on Bluesky? Move your account to Rostrum with every follower intact. Coming from elsewhere? Find the people you already follow.</span></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="kg-col gain">
        <p class="eyebrow">What you gain</p>
        <h3>An account that answers to you</h3>
        <ul class="kg-list">
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 3v14M3 10h14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div><strong>Your audience is yours</strong><span>Your followers belong to your account, not to a company. Move to another provider at any time and they come with you.</span></div></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 3v14M3 10h14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div><strong>No owner between you and voters</strong><span>No single company decides who sees you. People choose their own feeds, so no owner can throttle, sell or switch off your voice.</span></div></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 3v14M3 10h14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div><strong>Verification that means something</strong><span>Checked against the Parliament's own register. It can't be bought or faked.</span></div></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 3v14M3 10h14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div><strong>Moderation you choose</strong><span>Pick the moderation services that protect your replies, and change them whenever you like.</span></div></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 3v14M3 10h14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div><strong>European jurisdiction</strong><span>Hosted in Germany by a Dutch non-profit, under the GDPR and the Digital Services Act.</span></div></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 3v14M3 10h14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div><strong>A complete, portable record</strong><span>Every post, poll and answer is yours to export and archive. It stays with you after your term ends.</span></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
